walkway with the two winches (west side passage), then lead the three families out along it.","Everyone is out along the walkway. Go to Tessa.","Travel to Cinderwake (north-west, beyond Rootward) and find Ivo.","Power the three cooling channels (valves on the north wall), then help the crews clear the assembly space.","The channels are cold. Talk to the crew chief about clearing the assembly space.","Something very large is waiting at the east end of the slipway.","Wayfarer waits at Hearthward's berth. Find Corren (High Aerie), Pip (Veyr) and Sable (Whitebone) - in any order.","Set all three ballast anchors (north-west rock, settlement, mooring island). Cross the gust lanes between gusts.","All three anchors are set. Talk to Corren at the mooring lever.","Corren is back. Skyspine's anchor is ready for the release protocol.","Reach the lower registry through Veyr's changed canals (ladder, south of the square).","Bring the original ledgers to the residents at the tables and let them choose how their names are recorded.","Pip is back. Veyr's distribution point is open.","Open the three sealed cells one by one. Ask each person for their own consent key, then use it at their lock.","All three cells are open. Walk Sable out to the sanctuary exit.","Sable is back, under the survivors' agreement.","All eight are together again. Take the evidence to Nacre's assembly for the Ash Accord.","The Ash Accord is signed. When you're ready, fly Wayfarer to the Crown Heart in the middle of the Ember Sea.","The design is recorded. Remove the repeat-command mechanism beneath the chamber.","Bring the named records back to Mara in Brackenford.","Nera's concealed route is revealed. Draft the shared schedule with both camps at Brackenford.","Three observations: slow cells, many small lights, rest. Test the low-power circuit with the apprentice.","Take the recorder and testimony back to Edda at High Aerie.","The manual is revised. Have the crew attempt a cold restart at the engine lever - with Ivo only watching.","Check on the sleepers, then light the warmth channels to thaw the way to the sanctum.","Follow the beacons through the reef. Keep the return beacon lit.","Take the official seal to the registry clerk and offer the corrections.","When ready, use the split lever on the dock to divide into two teams.","Team A: release the first west lock. Then ring the swap bell to hand over to Team B.","West lock 1 released. Ring the swap bell - Team B's first lock is free.","East lock 1 released. Swap to Team A for the second west lock.","West lock 2 released. Swap to Team B for the last east lock.","Both lungs are open. Meet on the Concord Bridge (north of the dock).","Cross the Concord Bridge north to the Crown Vessel."],"objective":"Cross the Concord Bridge north to the Crown Vessel.","rumors":["An old quarryman says the heartglass started humming after the regulators arrived.","Bellharbor dock workers say the ministry is hunting a forger who turns refugees into 'cargo'.","Pip says the Drowned Archive opens its tide door at low water, south-east of Bellharbor.","Sailors say the Skychain's anchors failed; High Aerie is sending a volunteer to reset them alone.","Corren says the wind shrine above High Aerie's stair is older than the Crown.","Ivo and Oriel think a single relay could be released slowly, locally, without a captive holding it.","Brackenford's bakery is a footbridge depot now. Mara says the bunkhouse became a shelter.","Hearthward's ferryman has his caulk back. The ferry to the Glass Coast runs again.","Cinderwake crews are rotating heat between workshops with waterwheels. Someone says Ivo is in the old assembly yard.","High Aerie's broken chain now links two new islands. A cliff settlement there is evacuating.","Veyr's throne square is a distribution point. Someone is guarding the lower registry from Voss's remnants.","Whitebone's old cells are a sanctuary now. People with bindings nobody can safely remove shelter there.","Nacre is gathering every town's delegates by the listening pool.","The Wayfarer crew room has a board of leads - personal matters for each of you, and four strange ones besides. None of them has to be done first."],"source":"dain"},"last_town":"L_T01","links":{},"location":{"dir":"left","map":"D10_ALCOVE","spawn":"from_r04","x":10,"y":8},"party":{"active":["C01","C02","C06","C05"],"available":{"C01":true,"C02":true,"C03":true,"C04":true,"C05":true,"C06":true,"C07":true,"C08":true},"locked":false,"members":{"C01":{"equip":{"body":"G013","head":"G017","offhand":"G025","weapon":"W004"},"hp":2153,"level":39,"mp":50,"recruited":false,"starter_given":true,"xp":67173},"C02":{"equip":{"body":"G001","head":"G018","weapon":"W010"},"hp":1470,"level":39,"mp":94,"recruited":false,"starter_given":true,"xp":67159},"C03":{"equip":{"body":"G009","head":"G017","weapon":"W013"},"hp":2905,"level":39,"mp":126,"recruited":false,"starter_given":true,"xp":67212},"C04":{"equip":{"body":"G009","head":"G019","weapon":"W019"},"hp":2886,"level":38,"mp":164,"recruited":false,"starter_given":true,"xp":67052},"C05":{"equip":{"body":"G005","head":"G018","weapon":"W028"},"hp":1393,"level":39,"mp":56,"recruited":false,"starter_given":true,"xp":67125},"C06":{"equip":{"body":"G001","head":"G018","weapon":"W036"},"hp":1670,"level":39,"mp":216,"recruited":false,"starter_given":true,"xp":67150},"C07":{"equip":{"body":"G009","head":"G017","weapon":"W042"},"hp":2862,"level":39,"mp":170,"recruited":false,"starter_given":true,"xp":67294},"C08":{"equip":{"body":"G005","head":"G018","weapon":"W043"},"hp":2662,"level":39,"mp":128,"recruited":false,"starter_given":true,"xp":67217}},"roster":["C01","C02","C06","C05","C04","C08","C03","C07"],"rows":{"C01":"front","C02":"back","C03":"front","C04":"front","C05":"back","C06":"back","C07":"front","C08":"front"}},"play_settings":{"encounters":"normal"},"playtime":18805.0719004854,"quests":{"Q01":{"stage":"records","state":"COMPLETED"},"Q02":{"stage":"observed","state":"COMPLETED"},"Q03":{"stag